<title>HUNGARY: CESI falls, closes at 1,642.39 points, down 22.46.</title>
<headline>CESI falls, closes at 1,642.39 points, down 22.46.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index continued to fall on Tuesday and closed at 1,642.39 points, down 22.46 points or 1.35 percent, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, 1996, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
